config ZEPHLET_CLIMATE
    bool "Climate zephlet (dependency test fixture)"
    select NANOPB
    select ZBUS
    select ZBUS_ASYNC_LISTENER
    help
      Enable the `climate` controller zephlet, a consumer that declares
      `(zephlet.requires)` on one temperature sensor and two fans and
      calls them from its `regulate` rpc.

